SUMMARY:Anya Hinkle feat. Mike Witcher Live @ The Melon Ball
DESCRIPTION:Watermelon Music in Davis presents… \nAsheville\, NC-based award-winning songwriter and internationally-touring artist Anya Hinkle and Grammy-nominated Dobro master Mike Witcher team up for an intimate exploration of hand-crafted\, acoustic music. \nRooted in the sounds of Appalachia and seasoned by travels across the globe\, Anya’s songs have won the MerleFest Chris Austin and USA Songwriting Competitions and been No. 1 hits at Folk Radio. Mike is a Southern California native who has recorded with some of the genre’s top artists\, including Dolly Parton\, Dwight Yoakam\, and many more. This powerful duo brings a surprisingly dynamic range of styles and influences to the stage. \nHills of Swannanoa (Live)\nCalifornia I Been Gone (Live)\nBound Away\nDevil Chasin’ Me\nWhy Women Need Wine \nAnya’s Social Media: \nWebsite\nSpotify\nInstagram\nFacebook \n$20 General Admission\nThis is a BYOB Event!
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/anya-hinkle-feat-mike-witcher-live-the-melon-ball/
LOCATION:Watermelon Music\, 1970 Lake Blvd\, DAVIS\, CA\, 95616\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/100826TICKET-2-Mu53r3.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Watermelon Music":MAILTO:info@watermelonmusic.com
END:VEVENT
