SUMMARY:Barn Dance in Central Park
DESCRIPTION:Get your boots ready for a fun night at the Yolo Crisis Nursery Barn Dance in Davis! Enjoy live music from high-energy country band MoonShine Crazy\, free line dancing with Yolo Line Dance\, cold beer on tap\, local wine\, Buckhorn BBQ\, games\, raffles and more. Gather your friends\, hit the dance floor and enjoy a great night out\, all while supporting Yolo Crisis Nursery and local children and families!
