SUMMARY:Stained Glass Workshop with Salty Bird Glass
DESCRIPTION:Stained Glass Workshop with Salty Bird Glass in Davis \nSunday\, October 11 | 1-3:30 PM \n$125 Members\, $140 Non-Members (All materials included) \n  \nJoin instructor Tiara Nixon with Salty Bird Glass to learn the timeless art of Tiffany-style stained glass. In this workshop\, you will learn how to apply copper foil\, solder\, and finish your own beautiful 5” pumpkin. No prior stained glass experience is needed\, and this workshop is open to artists ages 14 and above. Space is limited! \n  \nPlease read the safety & liability form on our website before registering for this workshop. \n  \nRegister here: https://pencegallery.org/education/programs/workshops-and-classes/ \n  \nAny questions? Email pencegallery@gmail.com.
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/stained-glass-workshop-with-salty-bird-glass/
LOCATION:Pence Gallery\, 212 D Street\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/Pumpkin-with-pinecones-500kb-1cPpGn.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Pence Gallery":MAILTO:pencesocialmedia@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
