SUMMARY:Halloween Dance Party @ Watermelon Music!
DESCRIPTION:That California Sound! + Left of the Dial LIVE! Presents: That Halloween Costume Dance Party ft. The Sugar Pushers in Davis \nThe Sugar Pushers will de-liver their playfully paranormal themed Rock & Roll and phantasmic antics at Watermelon Music\, Friday\, October 23rd!  Step through the creaking doors of The Melon Ball as it transforms into a Spooktacular Dance Haunt for JUST ONE NIGHT! Come dressed to kill for the Spooky Photo Wall\, Monster Mash Dance Off\, and Costume Contest\, judged by KDRT’s That California Sound! \nIt will be Ghastly! Ghoulish! and Gloriously over‑the‑top.  Don’t Ghost this Mischievously Macabre Monster Masquerade!
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/halloween-dance-party-watermelon-music/
LOCATION:The Melon Ball – Watermelon Music\, 1970 Lake Blvd.\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/images-s77PdU.png
END:VEVENT
