SUMMARY:Zombie Bike Parade
DESCRIPTION:A FREE\, family-friendly festival in Davis on Halloween Day\, 2026! Featuring 25+ entertainment stations\, a BMX stunt show\, thousands of costumed riders\, and zombies falling out of the sky. The bike ride itself is the main event of the day\, but it is entirely optional\, so come on wheels or on foot. Money raised goes to our beneficiary\, NorCal Trykers\, to build custom trikes for children with disabilities. For a listing of full events for the Halloween weekend visit the Zombie Bike Parade website.
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/zombie-bike-parade/
LOCATION:Community Park Davis\, 203 E. 14th st\, Davis\, CA\, 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/Zombie-Bike-Ride-002-e1695416579904-vZKNSv.jpg
END:VEVENT
